<title>HONG KONG: QPL Int'l year net up 179.8 pct.</title>
<headline>QPL Int'l year net up 179.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended April 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)		13.5 vs 49.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)	 30.0 vs 20.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	     nil vs 14.25 gain</p>
<p>    Net				 578.39 vs 203.11</p>
<p>    Turnover			  3,376.55 vs 2,560.52</p>
<p>    Company name		    QPL International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		     October 8 to 15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable		October 18</p>
<p>NOTE - QPL International manufactures integrated circuits.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 55 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 25 cents) vs 20 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
